tsukuroi-census census-vN — host=plazirN — N-N-NTN:N:NZ — read-only
PLANE packages: BLOCKED (pacman -Qkk sample probe error: error: openai-chatgpt: missing required signature; root_status=ok root_mode=N root_uid=N root_gid=N root_euid=N root_owner_write=absent root_owner_search=present root_report=owner-write-absent root_intent=not-assessed root_src=default root_dir=/)
